The handbook states that parking is allowed only in designated spaces.
[[cite:obs-3f77a3d661c3adabb8cf07be5918b010206cfa3b "parking is allowed only in designated spaces"]]
Certain spaces are reserved for visitors and handicapped parking.
[[cite:obs-3f77a3d661c3adabb8cf07be5918b010206cfa3b "spaces are reserved for visitors and handicapped parking"]]
Parking in reserved spaces without authorization is prohibited.
[[cite:obs-3f77a3d661c3adabb8cf07be5918b010206cfa3b "Parking in reserved spaces without authorization is prohibited"]]
Additionally, there is a two-hour time limit for parking in non-reserved spaces.
[[cite:obs-3f77a3d661c3adabb8cf07be5918b010206cfa3b "two-hour time limit for parking in non-reserved spaces"]]
